## 5. РАБОТА С БД

```python
from sqlalchemy import select
from sqlalchemy.orm import selectinload
from app.models.trip import Trip

# SELECT
result = await db.execute(select(Trip).where(Trip.id == 5))
trip = result.scalar_one_or_none()

# SELECT со связями
result = await db.execute(
    select(Trip)
    .where(Trip.date == date)
    .options(selectinload(Trip.routes).selectinload(Route.points))
)
trips = result.scalars().all()

# INSERT
obj = Trip(driver_id=1, date=date, status=TripStatus.PENDING)
db.add(obj)
await db.flush()    # получить obj.id
await db.commit()   # зафиксировать

# DELETE
await db.delete(trip)
await db.commit()

# UPDATE
trip.status = TripStatus.CONFIRMED
await db.commit()
```

**Транзакция на каждую сущность:**
```python
for item in items:
    try:
        # ... работа ...
        await db.commit()
    except Exception as e:
        await db.rollback()
        errors.append({"item": item, "error": str(e)})
```

